{
  "label": "karindate10",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label karindate10:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I tap on Karin’s name in my phone and wait for her to answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate1.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I show up at the park to find Karin dressed a bit differently than normal.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This is the first time she's worn her casual clothes to a meet-up, and I have to say they suit her really well.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She stands nervously before me, saying nothing and just looking off to the side, waiting for me to take the lead.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which I’m fine with, of course. It’s just a vast departure from how I’ve seen her act on the soccer field.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But then again, the soccer field is filled with females and I have a penis.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So it goes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you not planning on running today?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate2.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, umm, I...went for a run earlier. So I thought that it would be fine to just...you know, not run today.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not keeping you from hanging out with your friends, am I?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know you and your sister are normally out and about, so sorry if you feel obligated to waste any of that time on me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate3.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?! N-No! It's not a waste at all!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m totally free today. All day. And if you’re worried about me falling behind on practice or anything then-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I’m definitely not worried about that. You practice more than anyone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate4.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": R-Right...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Karin nervously fidgets with her hands behind her back, digging one of her sneakers into the ground and tracing a circle with it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s a lopsided circle- one that would cause problems in art class.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is something wrong?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate3.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing is wrong! Everything is great! Super great!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not hiding anything behind my back!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t say you were hiding anything behind your back.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good! Because I’m not!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m starting to think you are.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate5.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": OKAYFINEHEREYOUGO!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Karin stretches her arms out and holds a bright pink bag several inches from my face.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s easy to see how much her hands are shaking due to how close she is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This is obviously the first time she’s ever given some sort of gift to a guy but...what is it exactly?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate6.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cookies...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I made...extra. And I thought you might want some.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But if not I’ll just throw them into the river.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s no need to throw anything into the river, Karin...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate4.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take the bag from her and lightly shake it around a bit.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It feels like there’s a good amount in here. I highly doubt that she just happened to make extra...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You made these specifically for me, didn’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate7.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": N-No! I made them for...my mom and dad!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But then I realized they were on a diet!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I suddenly had so many cookies and I thought to myself, “Who likes cookies?!”",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And then I thought of you!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": N-Not because I was thinking about you but because...E-Everyone likes cookies!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate8.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And that’s exactly what happened.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, whatever the case, I’m very thankful for them. Can I have one now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate3.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now?! No way! Wait until you get home!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They’re probably bad anyway!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, give them back to me. The river isn’t far away and-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll just eat them tonight...Thanks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate9.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...my heart feels like it’s going to explode and I didn’t even do any running today.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought you said you went running earlier?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate4.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": O-Oh! Right! Yes! That is exactly why my heart must be beating so fast. Definitely not because of anything else. Nope. Nothing at all.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, what would even be the cause of that?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Do you really want me to say it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate10.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please don’t...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I beg you...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to give Karin a break and not explain to her that she might just be a little bit infatuated with me for some indiscernible reason.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’d be lying if I said I wasn’t impressed, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hell, I can’t even remember the last time any of the other girls gave me a non-sexual present.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not to say that I wouldn’t accept something like that from Karin (I absolutely would) but cookies are still good.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It must have been hard for her to give these to me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, so, I won’t eat your cookies now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate1.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can always...text me how they were later if you want to.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, it would obviously be a little weird for a grown man to text some random [teenager] but...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know...we’ve got phones so...we might as well use them, right? Hahahah...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But anyway, what did you want to do today if you’re not going to be running?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-I don’t know!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If only there was...some sort of place that two people could go to kill time and...maybe eat dinner together...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I feel like the last time I suggested something like that she ran away nearly crying.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Has she really changed her mind about that already?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s very...unfortunate that a place like that doesn’t exist...right, Sensei?...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wonder what else there is to do?...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Karin.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Yeah?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you pretending to not know what a restaurant is?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate11.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-Is it...working?...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you want to go out to eat, just say it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s no point in trying to trick me into asking you out on a date.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate7.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": MMMMMM! Don’t call it that!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s embarrassing...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just...I mean...what else are we going to do?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t bring my other clothes and...running without a sports bra on is kinda not something I want to do right now...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can’t say I blame her. She’s rather...endowed for a girl her age.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well is there anywhere in particular you want to go? I still have some time before I have to leave tonight.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate10.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...Umm, right...Of course you’d have stuff to do tonight. That’s fine...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry for expecting you to stay with me any longer. It’s obvious you’re busy and-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, now. There’s no need to get all down on yourself. We can spend an entire day together sometime in the future.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That...really does make it sound like...you know.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A date?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karinthirddate12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karinthirddate12.webp",
      "alt": "karinthirddate12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": NGH!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Each time I insinuate something even slightly romantic or affectionate, Karin freezes up or cringes or does...anything else mildly comedic.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "With a sister like Kirin, I have no idea how she's able to act like this. It's the complete opposite personality.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just what the hell is going on with that family?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
